old was declining the entire time UFI \nwas on TD Ameritrade Institutional’s platform.  Moreover, the JNUG ETF only came into \nCase 2:17-cv-04947-TJS\nDocument 1\nFiled 11/03/17\nPage 50 of 87\n",
